<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>五输穴 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%BE%93%E7%A9%B4/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.155.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.2</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 11:15:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%BA%94%E8%BE%93%E7%A9%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>本输第二：法地</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-02/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 11:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-02/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>本篇重点讨论了五脏六腑与经脉之气在肘膝关节以下出人流注经过的部位，具体指出了每经井、荥、输、原、经、合各穴的名称与部位；另一方面，本篇也论及了脏腑相合的关系和作用，以及四时取穴的方法等等。由于本篇的内容，以详述五输穴为主，所以篇名为&amp;quot;本输&amp;quot;。</description></item><item><title>十二正经之井荣俞原经合穴总结</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-3-2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 11:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-3-2/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">针灸笔记</category><description>五输穴（井、荣、俞、经、合）与原穴构成经络治疗核心，井穴治脏病、荣穴调色病、俞穴疗时病、经穴主音病、合穴理饮食病，结合五行生克与季节调养实现“治未病”，通过四肢远端穴位安全干预疾病传变。</description></item></channel></rss>